# Allowlist, not a denylist. The working tree is ~12 GB (out/ 5.2 G, .venv 3.6 G,
# .git 1.8 G, local_test/ 1.5 G, notebooks/ 660 M, storage_dump/ 193 M), and a
# denylist would eventually miss something. Exclude everything, then re-include
# exactly the build inputs.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src
!assets
!docker

!scripts

# Re-exclude noise inside the allowlisted trees.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
*.egg-info
*.swp
